WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,040
Don't bump into me

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,040
I rely on my figure

3
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:05,040
What happened?

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,040
Now my throat has just straightened up.

5
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,040
talk less

6
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,040
You can go out today

7
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,040
No need to camp

8
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,040
It's too heavy to continue carrying

9
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,300
you want this

10
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,300
Very good quality

11
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,300
It can be used next time

12
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:19,170
You've wronged me even more

13
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:21,170
You want to take it back again

14
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:23,420
I'll thank you later when I get out.

15
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:32,400
Who can you blame?

16
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,460
Such a violent collision

17
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,660
I have to run after them

18
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:39,630
Gotta go

19
00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:40,730
You guys go first

20
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:43,050
It’s not that the teacher won’t let us go together

21
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:44,050
Then you go first

22
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:45,050
She will go in the middle later

23
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:46,050
I set off last

24
00:00:46,050 --> 00:00:48,050
Just in time to rest a little longer

25
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:49,050
I'm exhausted
